# Level 8 -> Level 9

# Objective:

Retrieve the password for bandit9 stored in data.txt, which is the only line of text that appears exactly once

# breakdown:

The uniq command filters text lines, but it only compares adjacent lines.
 Passing data.txt through sort first groups all duplicate lines together so uniq -u can successfully discard all repeated lines and output the single unique line.

# Command:
sort data.txt | uniq -u
